# The PC Connection Part III.

**Authors:** Chu, David L., Zilora, Karen S.

## Abstract
Presents a series of four applications of data acquisition, system control, and data analysis using personal computers. Covers topics of pilot plant information and control, automation of drug safety evaluation, analysis and characterization of petroleum resources, and high-speed analog-digital conversion connections. Part three of a series on personal computer use. (JM)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ340521

